{"id":"a1-u01","level":"a1","order":1,"title":{"en":"Debate","fr":"Le débat","es":"El debate","ar":"النقاش"},"tip":{"en":"Use 'although' and 'even so' to concede a point before you answer it: 'Although you are right about the cost, I still disagree.'","fr":"Utilisez « bien que » et « malgré tout » pour concéder un point avant de répondre : « Bien que vous ayez raison sur le coût, je ne suis toujours pas d'accord. »","es":"Usa «aunque» y «aun así» para conceder un punto antes de responder: «Aunque tienes razón en cuanto al coste, sigo sin estar de acuerdo.»","ar":"استعمل «رغم أن» و«مع ذلك» لتسلّم بنقطة قبل أن ترد عليها: «رغم أنك محق في التكلفة، ما زلت أخالفك الرأي.»"},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a1-u01-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"argument, counterargument, opinion","fr":"argument, contre-argument, opinion","es":"argumento, contraargumento, opinión","ar":"حجة، حجة مضادة، رأي"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u01-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"proof, premise, conclusion","fr":"démonstration, prémisse, conclusion","es":"demostración, premisa, conclusión","ar":"برهان، مقدمة، استنتاج"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u01-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"debate, controversy, dilemma","fr":"débat, polémique, dilemme","es":"debate, polémica, dilema","ar":"مناظرة، جدل، معضلة"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u01-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"compromise, concession, objection","fr":"compromis, concession, objection","es":"compromiso, concesión, objeción","ar":"حل وسط، تنازل، اعتراض"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u01-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"bias, assumption, criticism","fr":"parti pris, présupposé, critique","es":"sesgo, suposición, crítica","ar":"تحيز، افتراض، نقد"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u01-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"to claim, to defend, to refute","fr":"prétendre, défendre, réfuter","es":"alegar, defender, refutar","ar":"يزعم، يدافع عن، يفند"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u01-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"to conce